  "content": "<p><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b398475b-4c17-4ee6-a979-f094faf98217.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"432\"></strong></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>這個材質包仍在開發中！</strong></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">我正在逐一重新繪製所有方塊、物品、生物和UI材質</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">我不會改變原版的顏色——色相和飽和度都與原版遊戲完全相同</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">我只會清理輪廓和細微細節，讓Minecraft依然保持經典風格</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">我會在完成後上傳更多材質，請記得之後再回來看看！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>目前已完成的內容：</em></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1586230/description_dc17b446-5143-4c16-8c2a-af5b8b38dc21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></em></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>贊助：</em></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/ColdTom?utm_medium=unknown&amp;utm_source=join_link&amp;utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&amp;utm_content=copyLink\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://patreon.com/ColdTom?utm_medium=unknown&amp;utm_source=join_link&amp;utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&amp;utm_content=copyLink</a></p>",
